// prod flavor. PROVISIONAL bundle ID, taken from the Android prod
// applicationId: confirm it before creating the App Store Connect record,
// after which it cannot change. The prod Firebase project does not exist yet.
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.basmaacademy.app
